      "writtenOn": "2026-10-22T06:39:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For a validation rejection, the current PowerCap value remains unchanged and no PLDM command is sent. It retains the existing cached value, which may be device-reported rather than the last requested value. Later asynchronous device failures are separate from this validation error",
